error[E0403]: expected int32, got Session
 --> $DIR/after-field.nra:4:12
  |
3 |     export let x: int32 = 0;
  |                - 'x' has type int32, which its getter returns
4 |     | get: instance;
  |            ^^^^^^^^ expected int32, found Session
  |
  = note: a '|' clause after a member is an accessor clause of that member; class hooks are written after the class's '(', before its first member

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0403`.
